'''# MedSync Health, Inc.
# Human Resources Policies

## Paid Time Off (PTO) Policy

MedSync Health offers a generous PTO policy to support a healthy work-life balance. All full-time employees accrue PTO based on their tenure with the company.

- **Standard PTO:** All employees receive **20 days** of paid time off per year.
- **Director Level Exception:** Employees at the Director level and above are entitled to **25 days** of paid time off per year.

## Parental Leave Policy

We provide paid parental leave for all new parents, including birth, adoption, and foster care placements.

- **Primary Caregiver:** 16 weeks of fully paid leave.
- **Secondary Caregiver:** 8 weeks of fully paid leave.

## Employee Referral Program

We encourage employees to refer qualified candidates for open positions. Referral bonuses are paid out after the new hire completes 90 days of employment.

| Employee Level of Referred Candidate | Referral Bonus |
|---|---|
| Associate / Analyst | $1,500 |
| Senior / Lead (e.g., Senior Engineer) | $3,000 |
| Manager / Principal | $5,000 |
| Director and Above | $8,000 |

## Expense & Travel Policy

### General Expense Reimbursement

Employees may be reimbursed for reasonable and necessary business expenses. All expenses must be submitted through the company's expense management system with original receipts.

- **Software & Subscriptions:** Up to $50/month without pre-approval.
- **Client Meals:** Up to $75 per person.

### Travel Policy

All company-related travel must be booked through our corporate travel partner. Employees are expected to choose cost-effective travel options.

- **Air Travel:** Economy class for domestic flights. Business class is permitted for international flights over 8 hours.
- **Hotels:** Standard room, up to $350/night in major metropolitan areas.
- **Ground Transportation:** Use of ride-sharing services (Uber, Lyft) is preferred over taxis or car rentals for local travel.
